Design: I propose to enhance test‐time augmentation by expanding it to four views: original, horizontal flip, vertical flip, and both flips. By averaging the sigmoid outputs over these four variants during validation and inference, we reduce prediction variance and boost AUROC without changing the training procedure. We integrate this 4‐view TTA in both the cross‐validation loop and the `predict()` function, then report the mean CV AUROC.
